{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"1665","title":"THE PINNACLE OF SMARTPHONE PHOTOGRAPHY: MI 11 ULTRA LAUNCHES GLOBALLY","desc":"Equipped with one of the most powerful smartphone cameras, a premium display with Dolby Vision® HDR and a powerful Qualcomm® Snapdragon™ 888 mobile platform, Xiaomi’s Mi 11 Ultra is making cutting-edge technology available to users around the globe.","view_cnt":"2540","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1618825608","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/785_operatorx_operatorx_opx/19/04/2021/118e6d478dcf57c172ce979cf5e5e886.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://blog.mi.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Screen-Shot-2021-03-29-at-7.10.01-PM.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, March 29th\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;– Xiaomi announced the global release of Mi 11 Ultra, its most extreme premium flagship revolutionizing smartphone photography and videography. Mi 11 Ultra takes a leap in smartphone camera technology with the world debut of the Samsung GN2 large camera sensor. The device goes a step further with a triple pro-grade rear camera array essentially consisting of only “main” cameras, once again pushing Xiaomi to the top of the DXOMARK, ranking Mi 11 Ultra as the world’s best photography smartphone. With a WQHD+ 120Hz quad-curved DotDisplay, 67W wired and wireless turbo charging and IP68\u003csup\u003e1\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;rating, Mi 11 Ultra offers a premium flagship experience taken to the extreme.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLet your inner filmmaker out with an outstanding pro-grade triple camera array\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra marks a major milestone in professional smartphone photography continuing the pioneering legacy of\u0026nbsp;Mi 10 Ultra. The pro-grade triple camera array features ultra-powerful hardware which combined with advanced software earned it the top spot in DXOMARK rating.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://blog.mi.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/%E5%B0%8F%E7%B1%B311_Ultra_10-1024x768.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe device‘s 50MP primary camera uses the largest smartphone camera sensor currently on the market, Samsung’s GN2. This high-end sensor jointly developed by Xiaomi and Samsung is the first to reach 1/1.12″ in size, and is capable of producing staggering 4-in-1 2.8μm Super Pixels. Powered by Xiaomi’s very own enhanced night photography algorithm it is capable of effortlessly capturing bright and detailed images with as little as 0.02 lux of light. Mi 11 Ultra is also the first Xiaomi smartphone to adopt a multi-point direct Time-of-Flight laser focus system that features an accurate 64 zone depth map, allowing it to focus faster, more accurately and with a wider field of view.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra comes equipped with a 48MP 5x optical zoom periscope lense also capable of 10x hybrid zoom and 120x digital zoom. The 48MP ultra-wide angle camera is just as powerful, with the same Sony IMX586 sensor enabling it to capture a stunningly wide 128° field of view. This no-compromise hardware setup is underlaid with a powerful AI algorithm that efficiently corrects lens distortion to ensure optimal effect for landscape and group photos.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra builds on the legacy of previous generation smartphones, sporting both the highly-praised Dual Native ISO Fusion and Stagger-HDR technologies debuted by Mi 10 Ultra.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe device performs just as brilliantly when shooting videos. All of the phone’s three cameras support 8K 24fps video, and the main camera supports Staggered-HDR ensuring excellent picture quality and accurate, dynamic light and shadow representation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e120Hz quad-curved WQHD+ display with SOUND BY Harman Kardon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra is equipped with a 6.81” 120Hz WQHD+ Samsung AMOLED quad-curved DotDisplay crafted from E4 material. The display offers 1,700 nits peak brightness and can reproduce 1.07 billion colors, enabling softer and more natural color gradation, less banding and a more vivid color performance. Support for Dolby Vision\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;and HDR10+ ensure utmost image quality. A 3200 x 1440 resolution, 120Hz refresh rate and 480Hz touch sampling rate combine to create an ultra smooth, fast and detailed display. Encased in Corning\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;Gorilla\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;Glass Victus™, the display is also highly resistant to drops and scratches.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMoreover, Mi 11 Ultra supports Dolby Vision and HDR10+, ensuring ultra vivid picture quality with incredible brightness, contrast and color. With Dolby Vision, users can expect the highest-quality images Mi 11 Ultra is able to display, so their entertainment always looks its best.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra offers an additional surprise with a secondary small display on the back. It not only doubles as an always-on display showing key information such as date, time and notifications, but can also act as a selfie mirror when taking pictures, further enhancing the user-friendliness and innovation of the device’s camera features.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://blog.mi.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Screen-Shot-2021-03-29-at-1.52.31-PM-1024x494.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAudio on Mi 11 Ultra is as crystal clear as the image on the display, with the device adopting a dual speaker design and continuing the SOUND BY Harman Kardon collaboration started with Mi 11 for professional audio tuning. Building upon this strong foundation, Mi 11 Ultra has been designed with an even more powerful custom 1216P super-linear speaker unit on the bottom of the device, enabling it to reach 0.8mm max. amplitude, the loudest in the industry. With truly outstanding hardware configuration, smart scenario detection and a professional touch from a premium brand, Mi 11 Ultra can effortlessly adapt to different sound environments to provide optimal audio performance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e100% battery within 36 minutes\u003c/strong\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;with dual 67W wired and wireless turbo charging\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra carries on this legacy with yet another breakthrough, featuring outstanding 67W wired and 67W wireless turbo charging technology, the latter currently being the fastest in the industry. Both can charge Mi 11 Ultra’s 5,000mAh large capacity battery to 100% within just 36 minutes\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e, with virtually no time discrepancy between wired and wireless.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra features a self-developed 6x supercharge technology, a brand new 30V wireless charging integrated circuit, as well as a multi-level current control technology that allows for a 10% increase in charging speed\u003csup\u003e1\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe battery in Mi 11 Ultra is built with an innovative new type of a material: second generation nano silicon oxide cathodes. This material possesses ten times the lithium ion storage capacity of traditional graphite cathodes, efficiently increasing energy density and effectively solving issues with long circuits.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium ceramic build with IP68 dust and water resistance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra is crafted with a premium ceramic back that lends a soft and comfortable feel in the palm of the hand and creates a gleaming, high-end look. The device is available in two stunning colors: Ceramic White and Ceramic Black.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://blog.mi.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Screen-Shot-2021-03-29-at-7.12.30-PM-1024x771.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra offers IP68 dust and water resistance rating\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e. In order to achieve the IP68 standards, Mi 11 Ultra uses a high permeability pressure relief valve. The ceramic back on Mi 11 Ultra has a smaller unidirectional bend radius, reduced from 0.2mm to 0.1mm. The device was tested for resistance to immersion in fresh water for up to 1.5m in depth for 30 minutes, and have added charging port moisture alerts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlagship performance with Qualcomm\u003c/strong\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e®\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Snapdragon™ 888 and innovative three-phase cooling technology\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra is powered by the flagship Qualcomm\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;Snapdragon™ 888 mobile platform and comes with a lightning-fast LPDDR5 + UFS 3.1 storage combination. Along with the flagship specs, the mobile platform’s performance is boosted with a high capacity heat dissipation system. Mi 11 Ultra debuts Xiaomi’s new three-phase cooling technology, which swaps the processor’s original thermal gel cover for a macromolecular phase change material that boasts higher efficiency and better wrap-around properties, increasing its thermal conductivity performance by 100%\u003csup\u003e1\u003c/sup\u003e. With this three-phase cooling system, Mi 11 Ultra constantly and reliably delivers peak performance. Also featuring GameTurbo 4.0, Mi 11 Ultra offers a smooth and uninterrupted experience even for the most demanding games.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11 Ultra with a 12GB+256GB storage combination and will go on sale at a recommended retail price of EUR 1,199 via Xiaomi’s official channels.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMi 11 Ultra quick specs:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e1\u0026nbsp;\u003c/sup\u003eData sourced from Xiaomi labs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e2\u0026nbsp;\u003c/sup\u003eThe device has been tested and certified to be resistant to splash, water, and dust in specific laboratory conditions with the classification IP68 ingress protection based on IEC 60529:1989+A1:1999+A2:2013.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease be noted that the test conditions of water resistance include: submersion in static freshwater up to a depth of 1.5 meters, up to 30 minutes, with a temperature delta between the water and product being 5K or less. Ingress protection is not assured if the product is subjected to environments beyond the test conditions. We recommend that you do not test it by yourself. Not advised for beach or pool use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIngress protection will deteriorate from daily wear and tear and/or physical damage. Avoid charging the product, operating the physical buttons, or removing the SIM tray when product is exposed to moisture. Please carefully refer to user’s manual for other safety instructions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe warranty will not cover the liquid damage caused in the environments beyond the IP68 test conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e3\u0026nbsp;\u003c/sup\u003eFeatures available via OTA update when applicable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e4\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;5G connectivity may vary based on region availability and local operator support.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e5\u0026nbsp;\u003c/sup\u003eWi-Fi 6E connectivity may vary based on region availability and local network support. The function may be added via OTA when and where applicable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct images available here:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RyAoQJwrl1ByY-dOxjqxmSJhb69lQoHS?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(157, 161, 173);\"\u003eMi 11 Ultra\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003ca href=\"http://1810.hk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(157, 161, 173);\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/a\u003e). Xiaomi is an internet company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an Internet of Things (IoT) platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith an equal emphasis on innovation and quality, Xiaomi continuously pursues high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi ranked 3rd globally in terms of smartphone shipments in the fourth quarter of 2020. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, with 324.8 million smart devices connected to its platform, excluding smartphones and laptops.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2020, the company made the Fortune Global 500 list for the second time, ranking 422nd, up 46 places compared to 2019. It also ranked 7th among internet companies.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"17","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1618889537"},"common":null}